1
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,327
Lok'tar! Lok'tar!

2
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:14,840
We crossed the burning sea with nothing but our names

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,670
Built a home from ash and blood and iron chains

4
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:24,710
Hear the drums in Orgrimmar, the shaking of the stone

5
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:30,980
Strength is all we're given, strength is all we own

6
00:00:34,153 --> 00:00:45,300
Orc and troll and tauren, and the Forsaken too

7
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:49,970
Every clan a weapon, every scar a debt come due

8
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:55,450
They call us monsters, call us beasts, they never learned

9
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:59,780
The Horde does not forget, the Horde returns

10
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:03,730
Blood and thunder, blood and thunder

11
00:01:03,780 --> 00:01:06,635
Break the line and drag them under

12
00:01:06,685 --> 00:01:08,730
Lok'tar Ogar! Raise the war drum!

13
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:11,500
Strength and honor, here we come!

14
00:01:11,633 --> 00:01:13,690
Lok'tar Ogar! Hear the Horde!

15
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:16,760
Blood and honor, blood for war!

16
00:01:21,830 --> 00:01:31,190
Warsong Gulch is burning, the flag is in our hands

17
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:36,170
Alterac is trembling beneath the war bands

18
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:41,230
Every horn that sounds tonight is calling out your end

19
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:46,390
We bleed for one another, we die for every friend

20
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:49,670
Blood and thunder, blood and thunder

21
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:52,575
Break the line and drag them under

22
00:01:52,625 --> 00:01:54,690
Lok'tar Ogar! Raise the war drum!

23
00:01:54,740 --> 00:01:57,460
Strength and honor, here we come!

24
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,590
Lok'tar Ogar! Hear the Horde!

25
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:02,740
Blood and honor, blood for war!

26
00:02:05,620 --> 00:02:09,020
Our fathers fell so we could stand

27
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,380
Our sons will hold this land

28
00:02:15,650 --> 00:02:16,350
Throm-ka

29
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:23,620
For the Horde!

30
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,710
For the Horde!

31
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:30,980
Never kneel, stand your ground!

32
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:38,090
Lok'tar Ogar! Raise the war drum!

33
00:02:38,140 --> 00:02:40,940
Strength and honor, here we come!

34
00:02:41,047 --> 00:02:43,010
Lok'tar Ogar! Hear the Horde!

35
00:02:43,060 --> 00:02:46,300
Blood and honor, blood for war!

36
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:53,420
For the Horde!

